#!   LAST_SAVE_DATE="2021-12-17T14:43:30"
#!   MARKDOWN_DESCRIPTION="**Description **&#10;&#10;This custom transformer corrects wrongly formed email addresses.  It manages two cases: firstly when the email address do not contain the character&quot;@&quot;, the email address is replaced by the default email adress; secondly when addresses are separated by coma, the email addresses are separated and placed into independant list of contacts{}.&#10;&#10;&#10;**Input Ports **&#10;&#10;- INPUT: The input metadata records to process.&#10;&#10;&#10;**Output Ports **&#10;&#10;- OUTPUT: The process output metadata records with email addresses corrected.&#10;&#10;&#10;**Parameters **&#10;&#10;- DEFAULT_CONTACT_EMAIL: Name of the attribute containing the default email address or string character representing the default email address&#10;&#10;"
